{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char5025","label":"Crow"},"label":"Liberation","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_crow_04","next":null,"speakers":{"enikk":"Enikk","Narration":"Narration","crow":"Crow","Self":"Commander","jackal":"Jackal","Monologue":"Monologue","viper":"Viper","announcement":"Announcement"},"icons":{"enikk":"si_c904_00_s","Narration":"si_c999_00_s","crow":"si_c110_00_s","jackal":"si_c111_00_s","viper":"si_c112_00_s","announcement":"si_c999_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_1","text":"... The sentence for the Nikke, Crow, is as follows.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EnikkRoom","bgArt":"enikkroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_recognition_underworld","movie":null,"shown":["crow","enikk"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_2","text":"First. She violated the law requiring her to protect humanity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_3","text":"Second. As the conflict was between humans, there was ambiguity regarding the priority of her duty to protect them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_4","text":"Third. Even if she had reached the decision herself, it cannot be determined to have been made independently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_5","text":"An examination of past cases based on the foregoing has found no precedent of sufficient relevance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_6","text":"A new precedent has therefore been established by the legal A.I. system.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_7","text":"To prevent similar incidents from recurring, the following judgment shall be issued.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_8","text":"The absolute command shall be implanted in the NIMPH of all Nikkes, including Crow,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_9","text":"who stood by as civilians were killed:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_10","text":"\"The right to life of a citizen shall take precedence over that of a non-citizen.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_11","text":"That is all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_12","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_12","text":"Some time later, in the interrogation room at the Rehabilitation Center...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_13","text":"... You don't look too pleased.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_14","text":"Going to miss me now that I'm leaving the Rehabilitation Center?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_15","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_15","text":"No way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_16","text":"Then I take it Enikk's judgment didn't sit well with you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_17","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_17","text":"Enikk just decided what a human life was worth.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EnikkRoom","bgArt":"enikkroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_floraltribute","movie":null,"shown":["enikk"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_18","text":"The absolute command shall be implanted in the NIMPH of all Nikkes, including Crow,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_19","text":"who stood by as civilians were killed:","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_20","text":"\"The right to life of a citizen shall take precedence over that of a non-citizen.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_21","text":"Well... it's not like outlaws being treated as less than human is anything new.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_22","text":"It's just that now there's an official rule to go with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_23","text":"\"Should an outlaw be involved in a conflict with a civilian again,\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_24","text":"\"the outlaw is to be shot without hesitation.\"","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_25","text":"... What a shame.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_26","text":"I suppose that leaves me with no room to indulge my own little whims.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_27","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_27","text":"It's more than that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_28","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_28","text":"Enikk even denied that you have free will.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"enikk","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_29","text":"Third. Even if she had reached the decision herself, it cannot be determined to have been made independently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EnikkRoom","bgArt":"enikkroom","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["enikk"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_30","text":"Free will only applies when the subject is human to begin with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Jail","bgArt":"jail","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_31","text":"... Biologically human outlaws don't even get treated like people.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_32","text":"So why would they treat a hunk of scrap metal like me any differently?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_33","text":"In the end, Enikk, being the Ark itself, handed down a verdict that was very much in keeping with the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_34","text":"... It's been quite some time since I last stood before a court.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_35","text":"And yet, all I get to take away from this is confirmation that this society is still just as rotten as ever.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_36","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_36","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_37","text":"But enough with the gloomy talk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_38","text":"Now that my release is all taken care of, how about we take a stroll beneath the artificial lights for a change?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_39","text":"It seems you're the one who's been assigned to escort me back to the Outer Rim, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_40","text":"So I'll impose on you a little longer.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_41","type":"Narration","speaker":"Narration","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_41","text":"Soon after, at the gate to the Outer Rim...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"ElevatorOut","bgArt":"elevatorout","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_distress","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_42","text":"Cr-Cr-Cr-Cr...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["jackal","viper"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_43","text":"Crowww!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["crow"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_44","text":"Jackal, come here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_45","type":"Monologue","speaker":"Monologue","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_45","text":"Crow tousles Jackal's hair.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_46","text":"Hmm... You're out sooner than I expected.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_47","text":"You said you'd be spending a few days at the Rehabilitation Center, so I thought you'd be holed up there a little longer...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_48","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_48","text":"... You were gonna stay a few days?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_49","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_50","text":"Why'd it get so awkward all of a sudden?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_51","text":"... Was it something I said?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_52","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_52","text":"Tell me what happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_53","text":"Don't get the wrong idea.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_54","text":"A terrorist attack just happened to occur along the route I was taking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_55","text":"That outlaw put his and his daughter's lives on the line,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_56","text":"and I did the same with my own. That's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_57","text":"... The outcome wasn't particularly satisfying,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_58","text":"but it wasn't entirely fruitless, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_59","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_59","text":"What did you say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_60","text":"... {AccountData.NickName}.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_61","text":"I've been meaning to have a proper chat with you for a while now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_62","text":"Then, quite by chance, I learned that whenever a Nikke ends up in the Rehabilitation Center,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_63","text":"her Commander gets called in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_64","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_64","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_65","text":"Well, here we are. Don't take it personally.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_66","text":"I doubt this will be the last time something like this happens,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_67","text":"so let's make sure we're on good terms for next time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_68","text":"See ya, Commander!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_69","text":"Come visit the Outer Rim sometime when you're bored!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"viper","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_70","text":"Silly. If it were you, would you really come over?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"jackal","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_71","text":"What? I'm not silly...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcement","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_72","text":"The gate to the Outer Rim will open shortly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcement","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_73","text":"The area beyond the gate has been designated a danger zone by the Central Government.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"announcement","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_74","text":"Citizens are advised to take care not to enter accidentally. Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_75","text":"... I'll be going.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_76","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_76","text":"Wait a sec!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_77","text":"Do you have something to say?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_78","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_78","text":"I'll never turn my back on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_crow_05_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"crow","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_crow_05_79","text":"Wha